COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj_bizappscommon."ActivitySyncRule"."Name" IS 'Display name of the rule.';;

COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj_bizappscommon."ActivitySyncRule"."IsEnabled" IS '0 skips the rule without deleting it.';;

COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj_bizappscommon."ActivitySyncRule"."Sequence" IS 'Evaluation order within the connection. Lower first.';;

COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj_bizappscommon."ActivitySyncRule"."Action" IS 'Include or Exclude matching items. With no rules, the engine syncs everything the connection can see.';;

COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj_bizappscommon."ActivitySyncRule"."Direction" IS 'Optional direction filter (Inbound / Outbound / Internal). Null = any.';;

COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj_bizappscommon."ActivitySyncRule"."DateFrom" IS 'Inclusive lower bound of the sync window. Null = no lower bound.';;

COMMENT ON COLUMN __mj_bizappscommon."ActivitySyncRule"."DateTo" IS 'Inclusive upper bound of the sync window. Null = no upper bound.';;

