UPDATE __mj."AIAgent" SET
  "Name" = 'Person Lifecycle Changed',
  "Description" = 'The downstream reaction to a person''s lifecycle status changing (Active / Inactive / Deceased). Dispatched durably by the People·AfterUpdate Entity Action binding through Execute Agent, with the person''s ID and Status arriving as the Data payload (bound as a Script returning only those fields, because durable dispatch strips whole-record values). A deterministic Flow agent on purpose: it records the transition on the person''s timeline via Common.LogActivity and finishes — it creates work and completes, it never holds a run open waiting for anyone. Hosts extend the reaction by adding steps here (notify, enrich, hand off) instead of touching the binding.',
